# Surgical Extraction exiles its target, Shock, from the graveyard, then
# searches the hand and library with ChangeType$ Remembered.sameName, read the
# way AbilityUtils.filterListByType does (:853-868): the remembered target is
# the source, and sameName matches cards sharing its name
# (CardProperty.java:814-817), so the library's Shock is found and exiled.
startturn human
advance 3
queue payphyrexian false
queue targets 72
queue cardchoice 96
castspell human 1
resolvestack
